WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:09.278
I'm Giuseppe,

00:00:09.278 --> 00:00:11.468
I'm Italian

00:00:11.468 --> 00:00:16.098
and I started dancing 10 years ago

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:21.953
casually for an Italian choreographer,
Virgilio Sieni,

00:00:21.953 --> 00:00:27.593
that wanted to know more about
visually impaired people

00:00:27.593 --> 00:00:33.395
concerning the movement.
And from there I started my journey

00:00:33.395 --> 00:00:37.788
through many different types of dance,

00:00:37.788 --> 00:00:43.723
but always along the lines of Virgilio's style.

00:00:44.468 --> 00:00:49.553
Then, after this journey,

00:00:49.553 --> 00:00:52.078
5 or 6 years later,

00:00:52.078 --> 00:00:58.398
I've met many different artists

00:00:58.398 --> 00:01:02.990
and also dance companies
that work with disabled people,

00:01:02.990 --> 00:01:05.868
through international exchanges.

00:01:05.868 --> 00:01:10.993
Like the (Europe Beyond Access) Laboratory that happened here 
in Maastricht.

00:01:11.955 --> 00:01:18.253
From that moment, I started working
in other countries

00:01:18.253 --> 00:01:22.435
outside Italy, with other choreographers.

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:34.215
The first solo I did with Virgilio
was called "Atlante del bianco".

00:01:34.215 --> 00:01:40.593
It was a study on how colours
can influence the movement

00:01:40.593 --> 00:01:43.678
and how a movement can illustrate a colour.

00:01:43.678 --> 00:01:47.688
The performance had short transitions,

00:01:47.688 --> 00:01:56.313
the room and the space were all white
yet sometimes they were flooded by colour.

00:01:56.313 --> 00:02:02.313
Depending on the colors, the movement 
and the scene could change completely.

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:30.528
It is important that we can be
dancers and artists in general

00:02:31.173 --> 00:02:37.235
at a professional level.
For disabled people, it is very important

00:02:37.235 --> 00:02:43.560
to be able to choose freely
what we want to do.

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:47.190
Other examples are to have the opportunity
of going to school,

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:54.998
of enriching ourselves culturally,
in practice,

00:02:54.998 --> 00:03:00.903
and everything that can help us
to become a professional

00:03:00.903 --> 00:03:05.555
in dance and the arts.

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:11.198
This is what I want...
If possible, this would be the mission.

